            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sources"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start the game (⌘P)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lancer le jeu (⌘P)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Starting…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Démarrage…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam Folder": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Dossier Steam"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam can't pass these on, so Hangar opens the game itself, without Steam's overlay.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steam ne peut pas les transmettre : Hangar ouvre donc le jeu lui-même, sans l’overlay de Steam."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steam games get their covers from the Steam store. With a SteamGridDB key, Hangar also finds covers the store doesn't have, and covers for Windows games that aren't on Steam. Sign in with Steam on steamgriddb.com, then make a key under Preferences › API.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les jeux Steam prennent leur couverture dans le magasin Steam. Avec une clé SteamGridDB, Hangar trouve aussi les couvertures que le magasin n’a pas, et celles des jeux Windows qui ne sont pas sur Steam. Connectez-vous avec Steam sur steamgriddb.com, puis créez une clé sous Preferences › API."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "SteamGridDB API Key": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Clé d’API SteamGridDB"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arrêter"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop %@?": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arrêter %@ ?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop…": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arrêter…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System (%@)": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Système (%@)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tells games that Rosetta can run AVX instructions. Some newer games need it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Indique aux jeux que Rosetta peut exécuter les instructions AVX. Certains jeux récents en ont besoin."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tested with": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Testée avec"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bottle %@ also holds %@: it gets these settings too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La bouteille %1$@ contient aussi %2$@ : ce jeu recevra aussi ces réglages."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The bottle %@ also holds %lld other games: they get these settings too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La bouteille %1$@ contient aussi %2$lld autres jeux : ils recevront aussi ces réglages."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first one is saved the next time you change a setting or play.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le premier sera enregistré au prochain changement de réglage ou à la prochaine partie."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The game's files aren't at this location anymore.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les fichiers du jeu ne sont plus à cet emplacement."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library on %@ isn't connected. Its games come back when the drive is.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La bibliothèque sur %@ n’est pas branchée. Ses jeux reviendront avec le disque."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The new language applies after a restart.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La nouvelle langue s’applique après un redémarrage."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The recipe needs %@, which isn't in the bottle.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La recette a besoin de %@, qui n’est pas dans la bouteille."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These games last worked on %@. If one stops working, go back to its snapshot from then.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ces jeux ont fonctionné pour la dernière fois avec %@. Si l’un d’eux ne fonctionne plus, revenez à son instantané d’alors."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These settings change the bottle %@, for every game in it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ces réglages changent la bouteille %@, pour tous les jeux qu’elle contient."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file isn't a Windows program.": {
      "localizations": {
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ce fichier n’est pas un programme Windows."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn off %@": {
      "localizations": {
